1
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:12,400
Ukraine can either protect the most important big cities -

2
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:17,600
- Or the front line, which will be extra important for the counter -offensive.

3
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:24,800
We have heard that Kiev has good air defense - yet the drones manage to get through.

4
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,560
How to explain it?

5
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:32,400
An air defense is never 100 percent, but consists of different systems-

6
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:37,400
- From short-range to medium and very long-range.

7
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:40,360
The Russian robotic attacks are often a mix.

8
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:43,720
First it can be exercise robots without explosive charge -

9
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:46,680
- Or drones, to saturate the air defense systems.

10
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:50,400
Then you strike with cruise robots with the explosive effect.

11
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:55,960
An air defense is never 100 percent.
And the drones that cost 200,000-

12
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:18,080
Russia, then, what does their line of defense look like?

13
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:22,880
Since October, Russia has actually dug several layers in stock -

14
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:26,880
–A of minefields, shooting boars and tanks -

15
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:30,480
- To make the Ukrainian offensive more difficult.

16
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:33,600
You may not stop it, but you buy time -

17
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:39,240
- For Russian reinforcements that may come where Ukraine breaks through.

18
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:43,520
Here it is also important to remember that the Ukrainian counter -offensive -

19
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:47,680
- Can be several counter -offensives who see where you break through.

20
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:51,840
If you break through in one direction you can continue there towards different goals.

21
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:59,640
But most important is to break the supply that goes all the way to Crimea.

22
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:03,200
- The railway then?
-Yes exactly.
